==Strategy==
Just like the other [[Spacetime Distortion]] stages, treat it like the original legend stage they are based from. Stall the Teacher Bun Bun and Heavenly Hippoes using your [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cats]] and [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Eraser Cats]]. Afterwards, kill them using your general attackers such as [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]] and [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Slapsticks Cats]]. The Li'l Nyandam, Shy Boys, Wall Doges, Aku Doges, and Le'noirs can be easily dealt with by brute-forcing them using fast, high DPS cats such as [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]], [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]], and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]]. [[Million-Dollar Cat (Special Cat)|Million Dollar Cat]] can help with the startoff as his guaranteed crit with double bounty can get you a quick influx of cash to use against Bun Bun.

